WEBVTT

00:19.820 --> 00:24.124
The wound inside
my sealed memories

00:24.124 --> 00:28.796
When it silently touches the heart

00:28.796 --> 00:36.503
Tears of loneliness behind
the gentle smile

00:36.503 --> 00:41.308
I seek boundless strength

00:41.308 --> 00:52.119
I continue to run up with
what I believe in

00:52.119 --> 00:54.188
I want to protect

00:54.188 --> 00:56.523
I want to believe

00:56.523 --> 01:00.794
all the reasons for that smile

01:00.794 --> 01:05.165
The heat and the love

01:05.165 --> 01:09.303
I accept them all

01:09.303 --> 01:13.007
I won't let go of your hand again

01:13.007 --> 01:21.813
Aiming towards that light...

01:30.891 --> 01:34.725
Previously on Shonen Onmyouji...

01:36.997 --> 01:39.600
- My entry into the court?
- Yes.

01:39.600 --> 01:43.670
I've given Seimei the task of
picking a lucky day in winter.

01:43.670 --> 01:45.639
Oh, congratulations!

01:45.639 --> 01:50.338
You'll become the Mikado's
wife one day, Princess.

01:50.844 --> 01:53.714
If I enter the palace, I...

01:53.714 --> 01:56.547
Masahiro and I won't be able
to see the fireflies together.

01:57.451 --> 02:01.012
The scent is able
to resist evil.

02:02.189 --> 02:06.326
Princess Akiko won't be able to
withstand the pain for long.

02:06.326 --> 02:10.597
Thus, I have chosen
to bear her burden...

02:10.597 --> 02:14.260
by transferring
the curse to myself.

02:14.635 --> 02:17.297
I have something to
ask of you, Grandfather.

02:19.273 --> 02:22.299
Hold the Symbol of the Vow
Close to the Heart

02:24.578 --> 02:26.478
Back off!

02:29.516 --> 02:35.978
[chant]

02:40.994 --> 02:42.928
You're not leaving this place.

02:50.537 --> 02:52.869
Masahiro! Are you all right?

02:54.675 --> 02:57.511
- Don't worry.
- Don't lie to me...

02:57.511 --> 03:00.347
You fight demons every night
and you're exhausted.

03:00.347 --> 03:02.941
But... there's no time.

03:04.518 --> 03:08.750
I must do...
what I can... now...

03:11.558 --> 03:12.582
Masahiro!

03:22.903 --> 03:25.463
Seimei! You've got to stop him!

03:25.939 --> 03:29.643
- He's pushing himself too hard.
- You mean Masahiro?

03:29.643 --> 03:33.580
Who else would I mean?
He's still not ready for all this.

03:33.580 --> 03:35.449
Guren.

03:35.449 --> 03:38.018
Just let the boy do
what he wants.

03:38.018 --> 03:40.646
You won't be able to
talk him out of it anyway.

03:42.523 --> 03:45.754
Seimei, you're hiding
something. What is it?

03:52.132 --> 03:54.301
Masahiro is awake.

03:54.301 --> 03:58.032
If you leave him alone,
he'll probably sneak out again.

04:04.344 --> 04:07.438
Seimei, you must tell Guren.

04:15.088 --> 04:18.387
You do this every day.
What are you expecting to see?

04:19.593 --> 04:21.662
Well... Many things...

04:21.662 --> 04:24.153
Is it all right to
leave him alone?

04:28.335 --> 04:31.738
Are you actually concerned
about Guren?

04:31.738 --> 04:33.373
I'm not.

04:33.373 --> 04:37.434
What a pity! I was
just surprised there.

04:38.212 --> 04:43.377
So I assume that your concern
is for Masahiro then?

04:45.519 --> 04:47.588
I see...

04:47.588 --> 04:50.390
So you've finally accepted
Masahiro?

04:50.390 --> 04:51.692
I have not.

04:51.692 --> 04:54.528
I don't like the fact that
a trainee onmyouji...

04:54.528 --> 04:58.055
isn't learning from his mistake
when he almost got killed.

04:59.399 --> 05:03.301
Really! You're so stubborn.

05:11.945 --> 05:13.947
Princess Akiko...

05:13.947 --> 05:15.983
The physical wound
inflicted on you...

05:15.983 --> 05:18.252
by the foreign demons
has healed, but...

05:18.252 --> 05:20.621
I'm afraid that
the curse will...

05:20.621 --> 05:23.857
probably remain for
the rest of your life.

05:23.857 --> 05:28.351
And you will feel the effects
of it from time to time.

05:28.962 --> 05:31.498
But I'm not afraid.

05:31.498 --> 05:34.092
You and Lord Yoshimasa
are great onmyoujis...

05:35.435 --> 05:38.131
And both of you are
protecting me.

05:42.976 --> 05:44.910
But Master Seimei...

05:45.545 --> 05:48.315
I have heard rumors that...

05:48.315 --> 05:51.518
you've transferred
the pain and anguish...

05:51.518 --> 05:53.787
of my curse upon yourself...

05:53.787 --> 05:55.721
Is this true?

05:59.192 --> 06:00.887
I knew it...

06:01.795 --> 06:04.965
I was warned not to answer...
I should have listened...

06:04.965 --> 06:08.401
Though I was told... I...

06:11.938 --> 06:13.963
Answer me!

06:15.442 --> 06:19.173
Answer me and
I'll grant your wish.

06:19.680 --> 06:23.150
Girl, I'll release you
from your destiny...

06:23.150 --> 06:25.345
Answer me now!

06:31.058 --> 06:33.720
It was me...

06:34.194 --> 06:36.526
who brought this on you.

06:37.497 --> 06:43.103
I wished for my own freedom. Now
I got everyone involved in this.

06:43.103 --> 06:46.406
Even you, Master Seimei...
and Masahiro!

06:46.406 --> 06:49.710
Everyone has his own
weaknesses.

06:49.710 --> 06:54.545
The foreign demons preyed on
your weakness and exploited it.

07:02.356 --> 07:04.958
Do not worry too much.

07:04.958 --> 07:09.329
Masahiro will definitely seek
and destroy those demons.

07:09.329 --> 07:11.092
Masahiro...

07:14.101 --> 07:15.864
The fireflies...

07:17.237 --> 07:21.775
Masahiro asked me to go...
and see the fireflies with him.

07:21.775 --> 07:26.113
It'll be next year, since summer
has already ended this year.

07:26.113 --> 07:27.781
Isn't it funny?

07:27.781 --> 07:30.884
I'd never be allowed
to leave the house...

07:30.884 --> 07:32.819
and venture that far out.

07:32.819 --> 07:35.222
But Masahiro said
it'd be fine.

07:35.222 --> 07:37.791
He'd definitely take me
to see them.

07:37.791 --> 07:40.127
He would find a way...

07:40.127 --> 07:42.425
And he made a promise.

07:49.169 --> 07:54.274
Well, he's the only person
who's capable of being my heir.

07:54.274 --> 07:59.012
He'll always keep his promises
and never break his word.

07:59.012 --> 08:00.781
Yes.

08:00.781 --> 08:04.818
But don't let Masahiro know
what I just told you...

08:04.818 --> 08:07.912
We wouldn't want the boy
to become arrogant.

08:13.927 --> 08:19.957
Rikugou... Could you please watch
over Masahiro for a while?

08:22.569 --> 08:25.105
- Even though Touda is there?
- Yes...

08:25.105 --> 08:27.707
I'm rather worried
about that boy.

08:27.707 --> 08:29.436
I understand.

08:32.312 --> 08:34.906
What happened, Seimei?

08:35.949 --> 08:39.352
I heard you are here
because of an emergency.

08:39.352 --> 08:43.789
Lord Michinaga, we have a problem
that you must know of.

08:45.959 --> 08:49.162
Where did you see people
being spirited away?

08:49.162 --> 08:52.165
It's up ahead, at the house
with an old pond.

08:52.165 --> 08:55.100
Bandits hide there nowadays.

08:55.769 --> 08:57.437
An old pond?

08:57.437 --> 08:59.973
The water began to sparkle...

08:59.973 --> 09:04.239
And before I knew it, a few
people suddenly vanished.

09:05.212 --> 09:06.907
Scary!

09:07.914 --> 09:09.649
I've got to see this.

09:09.649 --> 09:11.651
Hey, Seimei's grandson...

09:11.651 --> 09:15.222
- You look pale.
- Are you feeling all right?

09:15.222 --> 09:18.358
Even the minor demons
are worried about him.

09:18.358 --> 09:21.862
- This is getting out of hand.
- Getting angry won't help.

09:21.862 --> 09:25.265
- How can I not get angry?!
- Mokkun!

09:25.265 --> 09:28.034
- Come on, let's go.
- Go get them!

09:28.034 --> 09:31.204
Our future depends on you!

09:31.204 --> 09:33.907
All the best, grandson!

09:33.907 --> 09:35.875
Don't call me that.

09:41.314 --> 09:43.373
Help me!

09:47.554 --> 09:50.857
I promise I won't steal anymore!

09:50.857 --> 09:53.758
[chant]

10:02.135 --> 10:04.603
Be good from now on!

10:10.744 --> 10:13.613
All right... brace yourselves...

10:13.613 --> 10:15.581
I'm burning you out!

10:31.698 --> 10:33.800
He's boiling the entire pond?

10:33.800 --> 10:36.132
That's pretty rough.

10:37.270 --> 10:38.838
Where is it?

10:38.838 --> 10:41.074
Why won't it come out?

10:41.074 --> 10:43.838
It can't possibly
withstand this heat.

10:46.212 --> 10:47.907
I see.

10:57.591 --> 10:59.354
I thought so.

11:02.429 --> 11:05.057
A foreign... demon.

11:22.048 --> 11:23.883
It wasn't in the water at all.

11:23.883 --> 11:26.886
It was hiding in the shadow
cast on the pond.

11:26.886 --> 11:29.013
In the water surface?

11:30.490 --> 11:34.594
Kyuuki has created another world
beyond the mirror of the water.

11:34.594 --> 11:37.931
A place you won't be able
to penetrate easily!

11:37.931 --> 11:39.592
Take that!

11:45.839 --> 11:47.374
What?!

11:47.374 --> 11:51.037
Master Kyuuki,
please give me power!

11:55.915 --> 11:57.610
Kyuuki!

12:01.921 --> 12:03.548
Masahiro?

12:10.296 --> 12:12.093
Masahiro!

12:18.772 --> 12:20.407
How amazing!

12:20.407 --> 12:22.942
The priest has my curse
within him.

12:22.942 --> 12:24.466
What?!

12:26.646 --> 12:30.673
No way! Seimei told me
he transferred it to himself!

12:32.118 --> 12:35.088
Poor, unfortunate priest...

12:35.088 --> 12:38.191
You were foolish to bear
the curse yourself.

12:38.191 --> 12:40.326
Now, you will feel my full power.

12:40.326 --> 12:43.955
You'll experience enough
pain to destroy you.

12:44.531 --> 12:46.733
You'll be in anguish
as the curse...

12:46.733 --> 12:49.035
slowly squeezes the life
out of you.

12:49.035 --> 12:51.905
That's both admirable
and stupid...

12:51.905 --> 12:55.909
You and the princess are
worthy sacrifices indeed.

12:55.909 --> 12:58.241
Leave him... alone!

13:25.672 --> 13:27.731
Why did you do that?

13:30.844 --> 13:34.380
You're not yet ready to
take on someone's curse.

13:34.380 --> 13:36.883
You could die if
something goes wrong.

13:36.883 --> 13:38.817
Do you understand that?!

13:40.520 --> 13:43.790
- Masahiro!
- I wanted to do something!

13:43.790 --> 13:45.985
Something to save Akiko!

13:47.393 --> 13:49.662
Although I promised
to protect her...

13:49.662 --> 13:51.564
Although I tried my best...

13:51.564 --> 13:54.556
I still... wasn't able
to do it.

13:54.968 --> 13:57.163
That's why, I...

13:58.304 --> 14:01.975
Did you know the consequences
of taking on the curse?

14:01.975 --> 14:04.010
Yes! And it's very painful.

14:04.010 --> 14:07.113
But the pain and
suffering I feel...

14:07.113 --> 14:10.241
means that Akiko's okay
and that gives me strength.

14:20.927 --> 14:23.828
I couldn't bear to
see her suffer.

14:24.464 --> 14:26.666
That's why I did
what I could.

14:26.666 --> 14:30.727
I'm willing to do anything to
protect her from pain.

14:33.640 --> 14:35.938
Whatever shall I do
with you...

14:44.050 --> 14:46.245
Come on, let's go back.

14:47.987 --> 14:50.217
You should get some rest.

14:56.696 --> 14:59.332
That boy knows exactly
what he wants...

14:59.332 --> 15:02.699
I can see why he's regarded
as Seimei's heir.

15:07.874 --> 15:10.944
- Is that Guren?
- You know, Seimei...

15:10.944 --> 15:14.581
Human politics doesn't
interest me at all.

15:14.581 --> 15:18.751
And I don't care who gets
promoted or marries the Mikado.

15:18.751 --> 15:23.154
But now... I wish
I could bring it all down.

15:23.857 --> 15:25.592
Really?

15:25.592 --> 15:28.584
For the first time, I thought...

15:29.028 --> 15:33.727
I wish I could change
someone's destiny by force...

15:34.367 --> 15:36.733
even if only slightly...

15:37.503 --> 15:39.266
I see.

15:43.476 --> 15:44.777
Kyoho

15:44.777 --> 15:45.945
Kyoho
That's Kyoho,
Kyuuki's minion.

15:45.945 --> 15:48.114
That's Kyoho,
Kyuuki's minion.

15:48.114 --> 15:51.851
Kyuuki is located beyond
the mirror of the water.

15:51.851 --> 15:55.622
- That's what it said.
- Those who were spirited away...

15:55.622 --> 15:58.358
have probably been eaten
by Kyuuki by now.

15:58.358 --> 16:02.128
How did they enter the realm
beyond the water mirror?

16:02.128 --> 16:05.899
So many demons moved into
that other world together.

16:05.899 --> 16:09.699
The pond needs to be big
enough to hold them all.

16:11.471 --> 16:15.601
There's a large pond close to
the capital. Pond of Hirosawa.

16:17.710 --> 16:19.735
Do you want to go
check it out now?

16:20.179 --> 16:23.637
I think leaving at night
would be a better option.

16:24.717 --> 16:29.086
That's right. Today is Akiko's
dressing ceremony.

17:03.289 --> 17:05.758
That's the Minister of the
Left's eldest daughter!

17:05.758 --> 17:09.729
The Minister must be relieved
that she's finally come of age.

17:09.729 --> 17:12.432
Now, we'll wait for
her entry into the court.

17:12.432 --> 17:15.731
That girl will be an
outstanding wife.

17:25.645 --> 17:27.914
The reading of her future
hasn't changed?

17:27.914 --> 17:31.250
Yes, most unfortunately.

17:31.250 --> 17:32.911
I see.

17:34.387 --> 17:37.690
Well, I'll leave everything
to you then, Seimei.

17:37.690 --> 17:39.282
Yes.

17:52.038 --> 17:54.040
He's working way too hard.

17:54.040 --> 17:57.635
Can he possibly defeat the
foreign demons in that condition?

17:59.879 --> 18:02.815
He should be capable of it
if he's Seimei's heir.

18:02.815 --> 18:05.885
Is he really that powerful?

18:05.885 --> 18:09.946
You weren't around when he
fought that battle at Kifune.

18:12.358 --> 18:14.427
After this is all done,

18:14.427 --> 18:17.563
we might have to accept
the fact that...

18:17.563 --> 18:20.293
he is the Seimei's heir.

18:32.879 --> 18:35.715
I don't feel a thing.

18:35.715 --> 18:37.116
No demonic aura.

18:37.116 --> 18:40.313
That's precisely what's
making me suspicious.

18:41.020 --> 18:43.648
It's like something's
wiped it all out.

18:46.759 --> 18:48.428
Kyuuki.

18:48.428 --> 18:51.261
But I can't feel his aura at all.

18:54.734 --> 18:58.170
His real body's on the other
side of the water mirror.

19:00.373 --> 19:03.576
Priest... Let's make a deal.

19:03.576 --> 19:04.677
What?!

19:04.677 --> 19:08.081
- What's the matter, Masahiro?
- Just now...

19:08.081 --> 19:12.051
Only you can hear my voice.

19:12.051 --> 19:14.654
I am now speaking to you...

19:14.654 --> 19:18.750
through the curse
that lies within you.

19:22.595 --> 19:25.198
Is Kyuuki trying to
communicate with you?

19:25.198 --> 19:27.567
Don't answer him
so readily.

19:27.567 --> 19:29.330
I know that.

19:29.936 --> 19:35.475
That curse will eventually
squeeze the life out of you.

19:35.475 --> 19:38.244
It will slowly destroy
your body.

19:38.244 --> 19:41.147
I released that curse
by channelling my power...

19:41.147 --> 19:43.138
through the claws
of Gaku and Shun.

19:43.549 --> 19:46.385
The truth is,
Fujiwara no Akiko...

19:46.385 --> 19:49.989
was originally the one
who was supposed to die.

19:49.989 --> 19:52.191
I'll eliminate you
before that happens!

19:52.191 --> 19:53.658
Masahiro!

19:54.660 --> 19:57.629
Consider my offer, Priest.

19:58.097 --> 20:00.633
Why don't you make
a deal with me...

20:00.633 --> 20:04.330
before that curse drains
your spirit and takes your life?

20:06.706 --> 20:09.642
You possess tremendous
power...

20:09.642 --> 20:12.912
and a determined and
remarkable spirit.

20:12.912 --> 20:15.581
It would be a waste
to just kill you.

20:15.581 --> 20:18.784
Live and be one
of my followers.

20:18.784 --> 20:21.254
Masahiro, don't answer!

20:21.254 --> 20:24.357
All I ask for is your power.

20:24.357 --> 20:27.827
If you agree,
I will grant you...

20:27.827 --> 20:30.523
whatever your
heart desires.

20:31.964 --> 20:35.968
I'll wait for you south of
the capital at Pond of Ogura,

20:35.968 --> 20:39.426
within the large water
mirror over there.

20:51.918 --> 20:53.977
Masahiro, are you all right?

20:54.153 --> 20:56.789
Yeah, I'm fine.

20:56.789 --> 21:00.059
You don't look too well.
What happened?

21:00.059 --> 21:01.856
What did Kyuuki...

21:03.896 --> 21:08.230
Nothing. It was... nothing.

21:17.677 --> 21:20.237
He's at... Pond of Ogura.

21:20.680 --> 21:22.841
Did Kyuuki... say that?

21:42.201 --> 21:53.713
I heard your voice inside
the deep darkness

21:53.713 --> 22:05.124
Just your phrase "I believe"
echoed in my heart

22:05.124 --> 22:10.930
You always stayed by my side

22:10.930 --> 22:16.732
You always gave me courage

22:18.838 --> 22:29.048
In order to continue
protecting our future

22:29.048 --> 22:35.988
I promise you, my beloved

22:35.988 --> 22:41.193
I won't give up

22:41.193 --> 22:46.899
I will keep overcoming my limits

22:46.899 --> 22:53.862
Surely surely surely

22:59.245 --> 23:02.078
Next Episode

23:23.302 --> 23:24.837
Next on Shonen Onmyouji...

23:24.837 --> 23:26.138
Episode 12.

23:26.138 --> 23:26.272
Penetrate the Mirror Cage.

23:26.272 --> 23:28.672
Episode 12
Penetrate the Mirror Cage
Penetrate the Mirror Cage.
